dq-visual-0206.question_text:
A frequency tree represents 56 students: 20 are boys, 13 boys did not watch tennis, and 17 girls watched tennis. What number should replace the star on the girls branch?

[tikz]
 egin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]\draw (0,0)--(2,1) (0,0)--(2,-1);
ode at (2,1) {girls};
ode at (2,-1) {boys};
ode at (0,0) {56};
ode at (3,1) {17 watched};
ode at (3,-1) {20 total boys};\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
